sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Workflows frontend
  participant API as Workflow API
  U->>FE: open list or workflow
  FE->>API: GET workflow
  API-->>FE: waiting_for_domain, enable_requested_at
  FE-->>U: badge "Waiting for domain"
  Note over U,API: the sender verifies, and the flow goes live
  U->>FE: open the workflow again
  FE->>API: GET workflow
  API-->>FE: active, went_live_at later than enable_requested_at
  FE-->>U: "Started sending" notice, once
  U->>FE: dismiss
  FE->>FE: store dismissal by workflow id and went_live_at
